ation or a rising venture.; Contact; Social; Newsletter.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #09090B, secondary #F4F4F5, accent #09090B, background #09090B, surface #F4F4F5, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus Enterprise</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        @keyframes float {\n            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }\n            50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }\n        }\n        .animate-float {\n            animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n        input:-webkit-autofill,\n        input:-webkit-autofill:hover,\n        input:-webkit-autofill:focus,\n        input:-webkit-autofill:active{\n            -webkit-box-shadow: 0 0 0 30px #09090b inset !important;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: #f4f4f5 !important;\n            transition: background-color 5000s ease-in-out 0s;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-50 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden selection:bg-zinc-800 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"glCanvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none opacity-30\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Floating Tags Container -->\n    <div id=\"tagsContainer\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col z-10 relative pointer-events-none\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 p-8 md:p-16 w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto\">\n\n            <!-- Left Column: Hero Text -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-5 pointer-events-auto flex flex-col items-start\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-12 text-zinc-100\">\n                    Partner with us to transform your enterprise, whether you're an established corporation or a rising venture.\n                </h1>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium border-b border-zinc-600 pb-1 hover:border-zinc-200 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300\">\n                    Let's connect\n                </a>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Spacer -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:block md:col-span-1\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Middle Column: Contact & Social -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-10 pointer-events-auto\">\n                <div>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-3 font-medium\">Contact</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-300 mb-1\">General Enquiries</p>\n                    <a href=\"mailto:hello@nexuscorp.com\" class=\"text-sm text-zinc-100 hover:text-white transition-colors\">hello@nexuscorp.com</a>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-300 mt-5 mb-1\">Phone</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-100\">+1 (555) 123-4567</p>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-300 mt-5 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Nexus Tower<br>\n                        100 Innovation Way<br>\n                        San Francisco, CA 94105\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-3 font-medium\">Social</h2>\n                    <ul class=\"text-sm text-zinc-300 space-y-1.5\">\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Twitter</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">LinkedIn</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">GitHub</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Column: Newsletter -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-3 pointer-events-auto\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-3 font-medium\">Newsletter</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-300 mb-10 leading-relaxed pr-4\">\n                    Join the Nexus newsletter for insights and our latest whitepapers exploring future technologies.\n                </p>\n\n                <form class=\"flex items-end border-b border-zinc-700 pb-2 focus-within:border-zinc-400 transition-colors group\">\n                    <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Add your email\" required class=\"bg-transparent text-sm w-full focus:outline-none text-zinc-100 placeholder:text-zinc-600\">\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"text-sm font-medium ml-4 text-zinc-100 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300\">\n                        Subscribe\n                    </button>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"p-8 md:px-16 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center text-xs text-zinc-500 z-10 relative pointer-events-none w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto mt-auto\">\n        <p class=\"pointer-events-auto mb-4 md:mb-0\">© Nexus 2024</p>\n        <p class=\"pointer-events-auto\">\n            All rights reserved.\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors ml-1\">Terms & Conditions</a>\n            <span class=\"mx-1\">|</span>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">Privacy Policy</a>\n        </p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- Floating Tags Logic ---\n        const tagsData = [\n            { text: 'Strategy', bg: 'bg-green-200', textCol: 'text-green-900', top: '55%', left: '10%', delay: '0s' },\n            { text: 'Marketing', bg: 'bg-yellow-200', textCol: 'text-yellow-900', top: '65%', left: '25%', delay: '1s' },\n            { text: 'Design', bg: 'bg-purple-200', textCol: 'text-purple-900', top: '75%', left: '15%', delay: '2s' },\n            { text: 'Development', bg: 'bg-blue-200', textCol: 'text-blue-900', top: '60%', left: '40%', delay: '0.5s' },\n            { text: 'Data Analytics', bg: 'bg-orange-200', textCol: 'text-orange-900', top: '70%', left: '35%', delay: '1.5s' },\n            { text: 'Cloud Ops', bg: 'bg-pink-200', textCol: 'text-pink-900', top: '50%', left: '70%', delay: '0.8s' },\n            { text: 'Security', bg: 'bg-zinc-200', textCol: 'text-zinc-900', top: '68%', left: '80%', delay: '2.5s' },\n            { text: 'AI Integration', bg: 'bg-red-200', textCol: 'text-red-900', top: '58%', left: '90%', delay: '1.2s' },\n            { text: 'Growth', bg: 'bg-teal-200', textCol: 'text-teal-900', top: '62%', left: '55%', delay: '0.3s' },\n            { text: 'Audience', bg: 'bg-indigo-200', textCol: 'text-indigo-900', top: '72%', left: '65%', delay: '1.8s' }\n        ];\n\n        const tagsContainer = document.getElementById('tagsContainer');\n        tagsData.forEach(tag => {\n            const el = document.createElement('div');\n            el.className = `absolute pointer-events-auto text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1.5 rounded-sm shadow-sm animate-float ${tag.bg} ${tag.textCol}`;\n            el.style.top = tag.top;\n            el.style.left = tag.left;\n            el.style.animationDelay = tag.delay;\n            el.textContent = tag.text;\n            tagsContainer.appendChild(el);\n        });\n\n        // --- Minimal WebGL Particle Lines ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('glCanvas');\n        const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl', { alpha: true, antialias: true });\n\n        const vsSource = `\n            attribute vec2 p; attribute float a; varying float va;\n            void main() { gl_Position = vec4(p, 0.0, 1.0); va = a; }\n        `;\n        const fsSource = `\n            precision lowp float; varying float va;\n            void main() { gl_FragColor = vec4(0.6, 0.6, 0.65, va * 0.5); }\n        `;\n\n        const compile = (type, src) => {\n            const s = gl.createShader(type);\n            gl.shaderSource(s, src); gl.compileShader(s); return s;\n        };\n        const prog = gl.createProgram();\n        gl.attachShader(prog, compile(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, vsSource));\n        gl.attachShader(prog, compile(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, fsSource));\n        gl.linkProgram(prog); gl.useProgram(prog);\n\n        const buf = gl.createBuffer(); gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buf);\n        const pLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, 'p'); gl.enableVertexAttribArray(pLoc);\n        gl.vertexAttribPointer(pLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 12, 0);\n        const aLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, 'a'); gl.enableVertexAttribArray(aLoc);\n        gl.vertexAttribPointer(aLoc, 1, gl.FLOAT, false, 12, 8);\n\n        // Particle setup\n        const numPts = window.innerWidth < 768 ? 40 : 80;\n        let pts = Array.from({length: numPts}, () => ({\n            x: Math.random() * 2 - 1, y: Math.random() * 2 - 1,\n            vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.0015, vy: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.0015\n        }));\n\n        function render() {\n            let w = canvas.width = window.innerWidth, h = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            gl.viewport(0, 0, w, h);\n            let verts = [];\n            const aspect = h / w;\n\n            pts.forEach(p => {\n                p.x += p.vx; p.y += p.vy;\n                if(p.x < -1.1 || p.x > 1.1) p.vx *= -1;\n                if(p.y < -1.1 || p.y > 1.1) p.vy *= -1;\n            });\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < pts.length; i++) {\n                for(let j = i + 1; j < pts.length; j++) {\n                    let dx = pts[i].x - pts[j].x, dy = (pts[i].y - pts[j].y) * aspect;\n                    let distSq = dx*dx + dy*dy;\n                    if(distSq < 0.04) {\n                        let alpha = (0.04 - distSq) * 25; // Fade out based on distance\n                        verts.push(pts[i].x, pts[i].y, alpha, pts[j].x, pts[j].y, alpha);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            if(verts.length > 0) {\n                gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array(verts), gl.DYNAMIC_DRAW);\n                gl.clearColor(0, 0, 0, 0); gl.clear(gl.COLOR_BUFFER_BIT);\n                gl.drawArrays(gl.LINES, 0, verts.length / 3);\n            }\n            requestAnimationFrame(render);\n        }\n        render();\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-enterprise.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-enterprise.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-enterprise-DESIGN.md", "views": 58, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T21:49:57.747405+00:00"}